{"id":"168249687","user":"154079163","service":"patreon","title":"バーヴァン・シー / Baobhan Sith - 真夏の迷い子 (Full Set)","content":"<p>新しいバーヴァン・シーのストーリーセット<strong>「真夏の迷い子」</strong> を公開しました！✨</p><p>今回は、夏の探索中にマシュたちとはぐれてしまった藤丸とバーヴァン・シーのお話です。暑さの中、ホテルへ戻ろうとする二人でしたが、バーヴァン・シーが持っていたアイスキャンディーをきっかけに、少し大変なことに……。</p><p>いつも応援してくださって本当にありがとうございます！💜</p><p>次の<strong>フルストーリーセットは、新しい水着姿のマシュ</strong>を予定しています。それまでの間にも、いくつか小さめのセットを公開していく予定なので、そちらも楽しみにしていてください！✨</p><p>My new Baobhan Sith story set,<strong>“Lost in the Midsummer Heat”</strong> is now available! ✨</p><p>This time, Fujimaru and Baobhan Sith get separated from Mash and the others during their summer investigation. While trying to make their way back to the hotel in the heat, one of Baobhan’s popsicles ends up causing a little more trouble than expected...</p><p>Thank you so much for your support as always! 💜</p><p>The <strong>next full story set will feature Mash in her new swimsuit</strong>.I’ll also be releasing a few smaller sets leading up to it, so please look forward to those too! ✨</p>","embed":{},"shared_file":false,"added":"2026-09-14T12:00:00","published":"2026-08-31T23:57:17","edited":"2026-09-01T00:41:36","file":{"name":"Baobhan Sith (1).png","path":"/82/0a/820a6fabbe73dded023303a74bb74e95042b9347a235746158de95c25941bd4e.png","preview_only":true},"attachments":[{"name":"Baobhan Sith (2).png","path":"/d0/cd/d0cd9e71df56a12576ce5b866b817e925f0870a1e63bdbd9508d70e3d087578a.png","preview_only":true},{"name":"Baobhan Sith (3).png","path":"/f3/7e/f37e3522c8341ba94c01d3957d6d01a9f40824f4da18331840dfe35c0aa6f80c.png","preview_only":true},{"name":"Baobhan Sith (4).png","path":"/b5/61/b56195d5cded865e8d3c814d581eb5ec5796396f078b434be83997d12f9a4e3e.png","preview_only":true},{"name":"Baobhan Sith (6).png","path":"/35/a4/35a4636d1a1fd2797b897f0cab44bef1b8446eca95ed63e51e750350f803cffd.png","preview_only":true},{"name":"Baobhan Sith (8).png","path":"/70/a6/70a6b4292ec21328a104e9bb657644a78db5c9cfada384379ff802c76d72283d.png","preview_on